  "documents": [
    {
      "schemaVersion": "0.7",
      "documentId": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1",
      "title": "道具神秘失踪",
      "summary": "开场前十分鐘，舞台道具失蹤，阿遙和小夏驚慌失措，決定將尋找過程演成開場。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1-start",
          "type": "cue",
          "cue": {
            "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1-bg",
            "type": "courtroom.background",
            "params": {
              "resource": {
                "packId": "official.courtroom-demo",
                "id": "background/lobby"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1-0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "不好！道具不见了！这是开场大灾难呀！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1-1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "别急，阿遥，咱们就像侦探一样，先看看昨晚有没有人碰过这东西。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1-2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "嗯，舞台右前方那个角落总是堆着一些杂物，也许是被挪走了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1-3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我去看看！竟然被当成垃圾袋藏在了音响后面，你别笑，我真是累惨了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1-4",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "笑什么笑！这下好，跟本没道具怎么办呀？！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c1-s1-5",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我有办法！用这个垃圾袋当“神秘道具”，大不了演一场“无实物”的戏！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "schemaVersion": "0.7",
      "documentId": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1",
      "title": "意外爆笑收尾",
      "summary": "两人变废为宝，用垃圾袋当道具，演得连观众都笑了，失物成笑料。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1-start",
          "type": "cue",
          "cue": {
            "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1-bg",
            "type": "courtroom.background",
            "params": {
              "resource": {
                "packId": "official.courtroom-demo",
                "id": "background/office"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1-0",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "等下，你觉得观众会注意到吗？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1-1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "他们会以为这才是先锋艺术呢！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1-2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "太棒了！我在一边准备一个巨型夸张的“风吹草动”手势。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1-3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "然后我扮成导演，一边嚷嚷着“特效就是这个！”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1-4",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "a"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "观众一脸茫然地笑了，原来道具就是那袋垃圾！所有人笑到起飞！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "openrouter-rehearsal-c2-s1-5",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": {
            "castId": "b"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "哈哈，我们成功把失误变成笑话，今晚的演出，由“垃圾包袱”开场！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
